#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:3
#: 9feb5bf1288644e183c323dfdfd2d786
msgid "有机构象采样（Organic Mol Config）"
msgstr "Organic Molecular Conformation Sampling (Organic Mol Config)"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:5
#: d876f6befa684b13b39c2707c8fb3d78
msgid "**分类：** 分子与溶剂"
msgstr "**Category:** Molecules and solvents"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:7
#: 244fe6326c4d46bba1a9713f7b0aaf23
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:9
#: addb8d1313894efc866bb75c47a94ac4
msgid ""
"对有机分子体系做单键子树旋转，并可叠加逐原子的高斯坐标噪声。程序先按共价半"
"径、距离上限和 Pauling 键级阈值建立启发式拓扑；只有从拓扑中删除后能分开两侧子"
"树的内部键才会参与旋转，因此环内键不会被当成普通可旋转单键。"
msgstr "Rotate single-bond subtrees in organic molecular systems and optionally add per-atom Gaussian coordinate noise. The program first builds a heuristic topology from covalent radii, distance limits, and Pauling bond-order thresholds. Only internal bonds whose removal separates the two subtrees participate in rotation, so ring bonds are not treated as ordinary rotatable single bonds."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:11
#: 65cdbb3b554a468885901acef086f3f9
msgid ""
"每个候选还要经过原始键对的长度检查和非键原子的碰撞检查；失败时会减半旋转角与"
"噪声后重试，全部重试仍失败的候选会被跳过，不会用未变化的输入结构冒充成功输"
"出。"
msgstr "Each candidate also undergoes checks on original bonded-pair lengths and nonbonded collisions. On failure, the card halves the rotation angle and noise and retries; candidates that still fail all retries are skipped rather than returned as unchanged pseudo-successes."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:13
#: 09f17f4262934465b75ddb1e72796d3e
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principle and equations"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:15
#: 2ee720541c1e4c1083ebaaf1ff8e879c
msgid ""
"\\Delta\\theta\\sim U(\\theta_{\\min},\\theta_{\\max}),\\quad "
"\\Delta\\mathbf{r}_i\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,\\sigma^2),\\quad d_{ij}\\text{ 的阈"
"值均按 }r_i^{\\mathrm{cov}}+r_j^{\\mathrm{cov}}\\text{ 缩放}"
msgstr "\\Delta\\theta\\sim U(\\theta_{\\min},\\theta_{\\max}),\\quad \\Delta\\mathbf{r}_i\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,\\sigma^2),\\quad d_{ij}\\text{ thresholds are scaled by }r_i^{\\mathrm{cov}}+r_j^{\\mathrm{cov}}\\text{.}"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:17
#: f824a80a3ef04a64b9985e3c30db2b8e
msgid ""
"$\\Delta\\theta$ 是被选可旋转键的子树转角，$\\sigma$ 是逐 Cartesian 分量的高"
"斯标准差， $r_i^{\\mathrm{cov}}$ 是元素共价半径。拓扑、键长保护和非键碰撞三道"
"检查共同决定候选是否 接受，公式中的随机抽样本身并不保证化学合理。"
msgstr "$\\Delta\\theta$ is the subtree rotation angle for a selected rotatable bond, $\\sigma$ is the Gaussian standard deviation per Cartesian component, and $r_i^{\\mathrm{cov}}$ is the covalent radius of element $i$. Topology, bond-length protection, and nonbonded-collision checks jointly determine whether a candidate is accepted; random sampling alone does not guarantee chemical validity."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:22
#: 164b49e9216d4a7e9b2dd94920a6aef5
msgid ""
"这里的“键”和“可旋转键”来自几何启发式，不是 RDKit 等化学感知工具给出的正式键"
"型。金属配位、离子对、非常规价态或已经严重畸变的输入可能识别错误；先看卡片首"
"帧预览中的“检测键数 / 可旋转键数”，再抽查输出。"
msgstr "The `bonds` and `rotatable bonds` here come from geometric heuristics, not formal bond types from a chemistry-aware tool such as RDKit. Metal coordination, ion pairs, unusual valences, or severely distorted inputs may be identified incorrectly; inspect the preview's detected/rotatable bond counts before reviewing outputs."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:25
#: e876fc5d8b8d44d482bd2807a634c8a7
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:27
#: 089a11fb190143e7a6a9f19c090cc156
msgid "场景：模型在小分子构象变化上的力预测完全不准"
msgstr ""
"Scenario: force predictions fail when a small molecule changes conformation"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:29
#: 598816f43b3744139f0dbe55e29b7d5f
msgid ""
"你在一个有机分子晶体上训练了一个 NEP 模型，分子内的平衡键长和键角都学得不错。"
"但你把同一个分子旋转一个二面角后，力的 MAE 跳了 4 倍。诊断发现训练集里每个分"
"子只有一种构象——模型不知道扭转角改变时力场该怎么变。"
msgstr ""
"You trained an NEP model for an organic molecular crystal. It reproduces "
"equilibrium bond lengths and angles, but the force MAE increases fourfold "
"after rotating one dihedral in the same molecule. The training set contains "
"only one conformation per molecule, so the model has no basis for learning "
"how forces change along torsional degrees of freedom."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:31
#: 6bd12c78cf434baea3d7db3c76687a01
msgid ""
"**诊断思路：** 有机分子的势能面在二面角方向上是多极值的（如 gauche 和 anti 构"
"象）。如果训练集只有一种构象，模型在这个柔性自由度上只能外推。需要系统地对可"
"旋转二面角做采样，并保留那些键长不崩、非键不穿插的构象作为训练样本。"
msgstr ""
"**Diagnosis:** The potential-energy surface of an organic molecule often has "
"multiple minima along a dihedral coordinate, such as gauche and anti "
"conformers. With only one conformation in the training set, the model must "
"extrapolate along that flexible degree of freedom. Sample rotatable "
"dihedrals systematically and retain candidates that preserve bonds and avoid "
"nonbonded overlap."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:33
#: 05d8dfbbb73a45009d022c07342dd8aa
msgid ""
"**输入：** 一个有机分子或全三维周期的分子晶体；程序按当前几何估计分子拓扑"
msgstr "**Input:** an organic molecule or a fully three-dimensional periodic molecular crystal; the program estimates molecular topology from the current geometry."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:35
#: 19f4e2dddad244b6b29f4327523fa09c
msgid ""
"**目标：** 每帧生成 100 个构象候选，扭转角在 ±60 度内采样，sigma 0.03 的高斯"
"位移"
msgstr ""
"**Goal:** Generate 100 conformation candidates per frame, sample torsions "
"within ±60°, and add Gaussian displacements with σ = 0.03 Å."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:37
#: 3eb63a877a3345aebe4409cc9facee62
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:38
#: 1f2ab041fd7a48af8f3498ef30b62b54
msgid "`每个输入的请求输出数`（`perturb_per_frame`） = `100`"
msgstr "`Requested outputs per input` (`perturb_per_frame`) = `100`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:39
#: 7c00a5db86574fa5aa8b0bfe6377912f
msgid "`扭转角增量`（`torsion_range_deg`） = `[-60, 60]`"
msgstr "`Torsion-angle range` (`torsion_range_deg`) = `[-60, 60]`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:40
#: ec7a8d899ad84bcb9812f5b0d0a691dc
msgid "`每个输出旋转的键数`（`max_torsions_per_conf`） = `5`"
msgstr "`Bonds rotated per output` (`max_torsions_per_conf`) = `5`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:41
#: e3d5a0fd2154411cbe980abd6d8d66bd
msgid "`高斯坐标噪声`（`gaussian_sigma`） = `0.03 Å`"
msgstr "`Gaussian coordinate noise` (`gaussian_sigma`) = `0.03 Å`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:42
#: 7bb404bdc8844dd997d3a4dc92d3bb5d
msgid "展开“拓扑和几何保护设置”，勾选 `Enable upper bound`"
msgstr "Expand `Topology and geometry protection` and enable `Enable upper bound`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:44
#: af55b5df183b48c091f116b1a329a078
msgid ""
"**输出：** 最多 100 个通过保护条件的构象，带 `TG(req=100,ok={实际成功"
"数},sig=0.03,pbc=auto)` 标签"
msgstr "**Output:** up to 100 conformations that pass the protection checks, labeled `TG(req=100,ok={actual_successes},sig=0.03,pbc=auto)`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:46
#: 7f5852589bd94aa8bd8a9927a5566eb0
msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
msgstr "**How to verify that training-set quality improved:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:47
#: 72ef5a0ae97e449088ae13dc5ebebdf9
msgid "重训后对手动旋转二面角后的测试构型推理，力 MAE 应显著缩小"
msgstr ""
"After DFT labeling and retraining, evaluate held-out structures with "
"manually rotated dihedrals; their force MAE should decrease substantially."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:48
#: 46c7df68a5d14b6793320dcdb6131393
msgid ""
"抽查键长分布：原始检测键没有短于 `0.6 * (r_i^cov+r_j^cov)`；打开上限后也没有"
"长于设定上限"
msgstr "Inspect the bond-length distribution: no detected original bond is shorter than `0.6 * (r_i^cov+r_j^cov)`; with the upper bound enabled, none exceeds the configured limit."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:49
#: 0651ffbc88104f4b8d346141f9148f4f
msgid "抽查非键距离：没有低于 `0.8 * (r_i^cov+r_j^cov)` 的非键原子对"
msgstr "Inspect nonbonded distances: no nonbonded atom pair is below `0.8 * (r_i^cov+r_j^cov)`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:50
#: b32b1cf2ec01466e9e8239affd7fbc81
msgid ""
"如果成功率低（< 10%），放宽 `最大保留键长系数`（`bond_keep_max_factor`）或增"
"大 `最大重试次数`（`max_retries`）"
msgstr "If the success rate is low (< 10%), relax `Maximum kept-bond length factor` (`bond_keep_max_factor`) or increase `Maximum retries` (`max_retries`)."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:52
#: 3275f4cd25d1487ab8ed2cb2ffaf2fa1
msgid "什么时候加这张卡、什么时候不加"
msgstr "When to add this card"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:54
#: 4a3dee42fb0c4d58bab7cb9ba1cf10f8
msgid "**加：**"
msgstr "**Add it when:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:55
#: 695ec06d12254f63a4128630f5cfda98
msgid "研究有机小分子、分子晶体或非周期分子的构象空间"
msgstr "Study conformational space in organic molecules, molecular crystals, or nonperiodic molecules."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:56
#: 163b7d8afbd9457481c0f7944667b490
msgid "模型对柔性自由度的预测差（扭转角变化引起力/能量跳变）"
msgstr ""
"The model is inaccurate along flexible degrees of freedom, with force or "
"energy errors changing sharply as torsions rotate."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:57
#: 1a0923aec6b2406c85a773f51bdf758b
msgid "需要覆盖分子内多种构象（gauche, anti, eclipsed）"
msgstr "gauche, anti, eclipsed"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:59
#: 4f0b3c7425924355b7a01f390ee442d5
msgid "**不加：**"
msgstr "**Do not add it when:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:60
#: 1f5a75d7d3c4448f809df4a2864327ba
msgid "纯无机体系（没有可旋转二面角）"
msgstr "The system is purely inorganic and has no rotatable dihedrals."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:61
#: 1133e38470c44f27b95ca78422eea48f
msgid "分子本身是刚性的（如苯环），且你也不需要高斯坐标噪声"
msgstr "The molecule is rigid (such as a benzene ring) and Gaussian coordinate noise is unnecessary."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:62
#: 9f761e4781b94a5bb7e075068453483e
msgid "需要化学价态、芳香性或反应键的严格识别；这张卡只有几何启发式拓扑"
msgstr "You need strict identification of valence, aromaticity, or reaction bonds; this card provides only a geometric heuristic topology."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:63
#: 409d80a7b05548c1b3a2dcc5b8b11071
msgid "只需要坐标扰动 → 用 `Atomic Perturb`"
msgstr "You need only coordinate noise → use `Atomic Perturb`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:65
#: 984d0f3256e74a04ab2ef43545ea024e
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:67
#: 0f427b8c598d43d1858a9ab02ed4fef2
msgid "构象采样"
msgstr "Conformation sampling"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:69
#: 670d5d13a221484dbf6b74815aadc2d2
msgid "每个输入的请求输出数（perturb_per_frame）"
msgstr "perturb_per_frame"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:71
#: 7bca843eb91c4d5da75e4726bb8bad8b
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 100。每个输入结构尝试生成多少个候选，20–100 为常规。保护条件失败"
"的候选会被跳过，所以实际输出数可能小于该值；若一个都没有通过，卡片直接报错。"
msgstr "`int`, default 100. Number of candidates attempted per input; 20–100 is typical. Candidates that fail protection checks are skipped, so the actual output may be smaller; if none passes, the card fails."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:73
#: 9d63f294573042328aef8033b7f15ccc
msgid "扭转角增量（torsion_range_deg）"
msgstr "torsion_range_deg"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:75
#: e22a7d0fe03045b182dda80da644ab21
msgid ""
"`tuple[float, float]`，默认 `(-180.0, 180.0)`。这是加到当前构象上的**旋转增量"
"**范围，不是输出二面角的绝对目标值。±30° 较保守，±180° 覆盖更广；范围越大，几"
"何保护失败概率通常越高。"
msgstr "`tuple[float, float]`, default `(-180.0, 180.0)`. The **rotation increment** added to the current conformation, not an absolute target dihedral. ±30° is conservative and ±180° covers more space; wider ranges usually increase geometry-protection failures."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:77
#: 3af15c851b444d22a12e112195f6aa49
msgid "每个输出旋转的键数（max_torsions_per_conf）"
msgstr "max_torsions_per_conf"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:79
#: 471fbaf8c21f4b11b170d78b6a7a93dd
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 5。每个输出最多选择多少条不同的可旋转键。实际数量不会超过首帧预览"
"显示的可旋转键数；设为 0 时只保留高斯坐标噪声。"
msgstr "`int`, default 5. Maximum number of distinct rotatable bonds selected per output. The actual number cannot exceed the rotatable-bond count shown in the first-frame preview; set it to 0 to keep only Gaussian coordinate noise."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:81
#: a1d37c4b562b4962b18d3c484feec5fa
msgid "高斯坐标噪声（gaussian_sigma）"
msgstr "gaussian_sigma"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:83
#: aa645414905348bbaf59a66ed658c225
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 0.03 Å。扭转之后，对**每个原子**独立添加笛卡尔高斯噪声；它不是"
"只作用于局部子树。常规可从 0.01–0.03 Å 开始。"
msgstr "`float`, default 0.03 Å. After torsion, add independent Cartesian Gaussian noise to **every atom**; it is not limited to the local subtree. A typical starting range is 0.01–0.03 Å."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:85
#: 2bc27aae9f34472587cb6a7cb718cfbe
msgid "最大重试次数（max_retries）"
msgstr "max_retries"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:87
#: da6999df549348a188ef82e018663f03
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 12。每个候选在保护条件失败后的额外重试次数。每次重试都会把旋转增"
"量和高斯噪声减半；增大该值会增加耗时，也可能让最终通过的结构越来越接近输入。"
msgstr "`int`, default 12. Extra retries after a candidate fails protection checks. Each retry halves the rotation increment and Gaussian noise; larger values increase runtime and may make accepted structures increasingly close to the input."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:89
#: 2c47704f5c6d477c82de25b895e80323
msgid "PBC 和局部环境"
msgstr "Periodic boundaries and local environment"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:91
#: 03a0f834e7f94608a696f3c05b245863
msgid "周期边界模式（pbc_mode）"
msgstr "pbc_mode"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:93
#: 9bfb062824514877aceadf9ff80832df
msgid "`str`，默认 `'auto'`。可选值："
msgstr "`str`, default `'auto'`. Options:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:95
#: b5a1c1df3a874f97ac449514a223875a
msgid ""
"`auto`：只在输入三个 PBC 方向都打开时使用周期模式；普通无周期分子不会因为带一"
"个显示 cell 就被误判为周期体系。"
msgstr "`auto`: use periodic mode only when all three input PBC directions are enabled; an ordinary nonperiodic molecule is not misclassified merely because it has a display cell."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:96
#: e35720812b404144bc6451b06ad31727
msgid "`yes`：强制全三维周期，输入必须有有限且非奇异的 3×3 cell。"
msgstr "`yes`: force full three-dimensional periodicity; the input must have a finite, nonsingular 3×3 cell."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:97
#: 0695b1d7e006409fb7b9293d783d1267
msgid "`no`：按非周期分子处理，并在输出中写入显示盒。"
msgstr "`no`: treat the input as a nonperiodic molecule and write a display box to the output."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:99
#: 5122a5d8999341198e1823167a93f37f
msgid ""
"二维或一维混合 PBC 暂不支持；`auto` 会明确报错，不会把部分周期静默改成全三维"
"周期。"
msgstr "Mixed two- or one-dimensional PBC is not supported yet; `auto` fails explicitly instead of silently converting partial periodicity to full three-dimensional periodicity."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:101
#: 561ee9c8192348f198be3f62be84171a
msgid "局部截断距离（local_cutoff）"
msgstr "local_cutoff"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:103
#: c9c22a167b9040139b38d0bbc33b24cd
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 150。这不是距离 cutoff，而是切换局部模式的**总原子数阈值**。当输"
"入原子数大于该值时，每次旋转的子树会受 `仅旋转局部子树`（`local_subtree`）限"
"制；小体系则旋转完整一侧子树。"
msgstr "`int`, default 150. This is not a distance cutoff, but the **total-atom threshold** for switching to local mode. When the input exceeds it, each rotation is limited by `Rotate local subtree only` (`local_subtree`); smaller systems rotate the complete subtree on one side."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:105
#: 1d6dcc8df8d6409b9e5f5e8e17302ea6
msgid "仅旋转局部子树（local_subtree）"
msgstr "local_subtree"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:107
#: c1b3edc4ad1848f0b70a387a1c4d48f1
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 40。局部模式中，一条键一侧最多一起旋转的原子数。它只有在输入原子"
"数超过 `局部截断距离`（`local_cutoff`）时生效。"
msgstr "`int`, default 40. In local mode, maximum number of atoms rotated together on one side of a bond. It takes effect only when the input exceeds `Local cutoff` (`local_cutoff`)."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:109
#: 6a6750f4d3204cbcb1eafbf8d9d6a242
msgid "非周期晶胞尺寸（nonpbc_box_size）"
msgstr "nonpbc_box_size"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:111
#: a9f321eeac514033bf3d0640830305bd
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 100.0 Å。非周期输出被居中后写入的立方显示 cell 边长。输出 PBC "
"仍为 false，因此该盒子不会参与碰撞检查，也不会制造周期镜像。"
msgstr "`float`, default 100.0 Å. Edge length of the cubic display cell written after centering a nonperiodic output. Output PBC remains false, so this box is not used for collision checks and does not create periodic images."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:113
#: 6188bc93a06e434eae123f57122e3461
msgid "键识别和键长约束"
msgstr "Bond detection and bond-length constraints"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:115
#: 4eda892b366c4c3ebbc36db8025adb12
msgid "成键识别系数（bond_detect_factor）"
msgstr "bond_detect_factor"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:117
#: 8713379292ac45298b37253811478661
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 1.15。候选键距离必须不超过 `factor * (r_i^cov+r_j^cov)`，同时还"
"要通过 `键级阈值`（`bo_threshold`）。数值越大越容易把相邻分子或配位接触误识别"
"为键。"
msgstr "`float`, default 1.15. Candidate bond distances must not exceed `factor * (r_i^cov+r_j^cov)` and must pass `Bond-order threshold` (`bo_threshold`). Larger values make adjacent molecules or coordination contacts more likely to be misidentified as bonds."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:119
#: 4a15ce87692541c5a14035b861ece926
msgid "最小保留键长系数（bond_keep_min_factor）"
msgstr "bond_keep_min_factor"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:121
#: 3275ecdf77d3417a888994dd61fd3520
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 0.6。原始检测键允许的最短距离为 `factor * (r_i^cov+r_j^cov)`。"
"它防的是过度压缩，不是断键；设太大会拒绝合理的短键。"
msgstr "`float`, default 0.6. The shortest allowed original detected bond is `factor * (r_i^cov+r_j^cov)`. This prevents over-compression, not bond breaking; setting it too high rejects reasonable short bonds."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:123
#: 4e67f5588ef44378ab8705833ca7bd01
msgid "最大保留键长系数（bond_keep_max_factor）"
msgstr "bond_keep_max_factor"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:125
#: f754aeb0c38a44c8a670622c43ed82ac
msgid "`float`，默认 1.15。勾选上限后，原始检测键允许的最长距离系数。"
msgstr "`float`, default 1.15. Maximum distance factor for original detected bonds when the upper bound is enabled."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:127
#: 8e897fc649834128a37463731f19fa22
msgid "启用最大保留键长（bond_keep_max_enable）"
msgstr "bond_keep_max_enable"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:129
#: db97d8e4844a486ebb0820000292e42e
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 false。打开后才启用键长上限检查；关闭时没有隐藏的默认上限。研究"
"非反应构象时建议打开；反应路径或软配位键可能需要关闭。"
msgstr "`bool`, default false. Enables the bond-length upper-bound check; when disabled, no hidden default upper bound applies. Enable it for nonreactive conformations; reaction paths or soft coordination bonds may require it to remain disabled."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:131
#: e8bc31ed599e4d2d94b022fc52391302
msgid "多重键系数（mult_bond_factor）"
msgstr "mult_bond_factor"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:133
#: 63e938cae2d44c019d2a4329d19fbbb3
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 0.87。短于 `factor * (r_i^cov+r_j^cov)` 的键不参与旋转；估计键"
"级大于等于 2 的键也不参与。环内键由于不是拓扑桥边，同样不会旋转。"
msgstr "`float`, default 0.87. Bonds shorter than `factor * (r_i^cov+r_j^cov)` are not rotated; estimated bond order ≥ 2 is also excluded. Ring bonds are likewise not rotated because they are not topological bridge edges."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:135
#: 784fd96182a1444e9d0ef1622e2bc42e
msgid "键级 C 常数（bo_c_const）"
msgstr "bo_c_const"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:137
#: 1a15075e2745415fb7f2218996ff15ca
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 0.3 Å。用于 `exp((r_i^cov+r_j^cov-d)/c)` 的衰减常数。它影响拓扑"
"边和估计键级，除非预览中的检测键数明显不合理，否则保持默认。"
msgstr "`float`, default 0.3 Å. Decay constant in `exp((r_i^cov+r_j^cov-d)/c)`. It affects topology edges and estimated bond order; keep the default unless the preview's detected-bond count is clearly unreasonable."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:139
#: 54ad2e65583747b7aefcaeff7272778e
msgid "键级阈值（bo_threshold）"
msgstr "bo_threshold"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:141
#: 445abe5f3aae4c6ea195075711e4c619
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 0.2。估计 Pauling 键级必须高于该值才会形成拓扑边；阈值越低，越"
"容易把弱接触当成键。"
msgstr "`float`, default 0.2. The estimated Pauling bond order must exceed this value to form a topology edge; lower thresholds more easily treat weak contacts as bonds."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:143
#: b42bbaddef664defb03ee497c5d632f7
msgid "非键约束"
msgstr "Nonbonded constraints"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:145
#: d506d5b2a44b4c8494582cf4505a9184
msgid "非键原子最小距离系数（nonbond_min_factor）"
msgstr "nonbond_min_factor"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:147
#: 695f0dd111514ae4af50397e67666ac8
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 0.8。非键原子允许的最近距离为 `factor * (r_i^cov+r_j^cov)`；这"
"里使用的是共价半径，不是范德华半径。发现穿插时可适当调大，但过大会大量拒绝紧"
"密堆积的分子晶体候选。"
msgstr "`float`, default 0.8. The nearest allowed nonbonded distance is `factor * (r_i^cov+r_j^cov)`; covalent radii, not van der Waals radii, are used. Increase it moderately when atoms interpenetrate, but an excessive value rejects many densely packed molecular-crystal candidates."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:149
#: cb6e57d1265f477183fcf463ef38cc8d
msgid "随机性"
msgstr "Randomness"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:151
#: 497ec9eea67b4d54a00aa110ecb048ba
msgid "使用随机种子（use_seed）"
msgstr "use_seed"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:153
#: 4d46bd0b88d34af59058de17a51bcb59
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 false。打开 + 固定 seed 后同参数同输入可复现。种子与结构的稳定 "
"ID 联合影响采样路径。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default: `false`. Enable with a fixed seed for reproducible sampling "
"from the same input and parameters. The seed and the structure's stable ID "
"jointly determine the sampling path."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:155
#: 793e1ac5fa39474a9deb8bd25c8168f4
msgid "随机种子（seed）"
msgstr "seed"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:157
#: 61be50d258b447a293cf7ec12cedf718
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 0。固定随机种子值。仅 `使用随机种子`（`use_seed`）打开时生效，两"
"个不同 seed 产生两组不同的扭转角和扰动方向。"
msgstr "`int`, default 0. Fixed random-seed value. Used only when `Use random seed` (`use_seed`) is enabled; different seeds produce different torsion angles and perturbation directions."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:159
#: fd78307ec2844b39aac3fe2b9548c2fa
msgid "生效条件：`use_seed=True`。"
msgstr "Active only when `use_seed=True`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:161
#: b01a575c77ab4056a84ed2d8b5bcecd6
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr "Recommended presets"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:163
#: fb7da8b6b7f449f29597f6201717555a
msgid "保守（小角度扭转，±30°，50 候选）"
msgstr "Conservative (small torsions, ±30°, 50 candidates)"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:164
#: f6692b59abf046b7b446419d0ef99ed5
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"OrganicMolConfigPBCCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"perturb_per_frame\": 50,\n"
"    \"torsion_range_deg\": [-30, 30],\n"
"    \"max_torsions_per_conf\": 3,\n"
"    \"gaussian_sigma\": 0.01,\n"
"    \"pbc_mode\": \"auto\",\n"
"    \"local_cutoff\": 150,\n"
"    \"local_subtree\": 40,\n"
"    \"bond_detect_factor\": 1.15,\n"
"    \"bond_keep_min_factor\": 0.6,\n"
"    \"bond_keep_max_factor\": 1.15,\n"
"    \"bond_keep_max_enable\": true,\n"
"    \"nonbond_min_factor\": 0.8,\n"
"    \"max_retries\": 12,\n"
"    \"mult_bond_factor\": 0.87,\n"
"    \"nonpbc_box_size\": 100.0,\n"
"    \"bo_c_const\": 0.3,\n"
"    \"bo_threshold\": 0.2,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 42\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:192
#: 5c6bc0d0890545aab9d48577a3ad93e9
msgid "平衡（中等扭转，±60°，100 候选）"
msgstr "Balanced (moderate torsions, ±60°, 100 candidates)"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:193
#: d21a1965098c47ce99c4bc6686cf2f05
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"OrganicMolConfigPBCCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"perturb_per_frame\": 100,\n"
"    \"torsion_range_deg\": [-60, 60],\n"
"    \"max_torsions_per_conf\": 5,\n"
"    \"gaussian_sigma\": 0.03,\n"
"    \"pbc_mode\": \"auto\",\n"
"    \"local_cutoff\": 150,\n"
"    \"local_subtree\": 40,\n"
"    \"bond_detect_factor\": 1.15,\n"
"    \"bond_keep_min_factor\": 0.6,\n"
"    \"bond_keep_max_factor\": 1.15,\n"
"    \"bond_keep_max_enable\": true,\n"
"    \"nonbond_min_factor\": 0.8,\n"
"    \"max_retries\": 12,\n"
"    \"mult_bond_factor\": 0.87,\n"
"    \"nonpbc_box_size\": 100.0,\n"
"    \"bo_c_const\": 0.3,\n"
"    \"bo_threshold\": 0.2,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 42\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:221
#: 264af265fdc442599ad394e159eb982f
msgid "探索（大角度扭转，±120°，100 候选）"
msgstr "Exploratory (large torsions, ±120°, 100 candidates)"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:222
#: 293cfe2958da4199a18ec7deda05b114
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"OrganicMolConfigPBCCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"perturb_per_frame\": 100,\n"
"    \"torsion_range_deg\": [-120, 120],\n"
"    \"max_torsions_per_conf\": 8,\n"
"    \"gaussian_sigma\": 0.05,\n"
"    \"pbc_mode\": \"auto\",\n"
"    \"local_cutoff\": 150,\n"
"    \"local_subtree\": 40,\n"
"    \"bond_detect_factor\": 1.15,\n"
"    \"bond_keep_min_factor\": 0.6,\n"
"    \"bond_keep_max_factor\": 1.15,\n"
"    \"bond_keep_max_enable\": true,\n"
"    \"nonbond_min_factor\": 0.8,\n"
"    \"max_retries\": 20,\n"
"    \"mult_bond_factor\": 0.87,\n"
"    \"nonpbc_box_size\": 100.0,\n"
"    \"bo_c_const\": 0.3,\n"
"    \"bo_threshold\": 0.2,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 42\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:250
#: b8498f24452843e1a9c54e6d10e582bd
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:252
#: 141a921a767f4e2b9bf597c2943c68e2
msgid "`Organic Mol Config` → `Atomic Perturb`：先做构象主采样，再加轻度热噪声"
msgstr ""
"`Organic Mol Config` → `Atomic Perturb`: sample the main conformational "
"degrees of freedom, then add mild thermal-like noise."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:253
#: f823cd518cb14277b2f42343f137be77
msgid "`Organic Mol Config` → `FPS Filter`：大批量生成后做代表性筛选"
msgstr ""
"`Organic Mol Config` → `FPS Filter`: select representative structures after "
"large-scale generation."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:254
#: a2499ae0ef2140318be69f0fd8f57b9a
msgid "对有机体系后筛时，优先看键长、非键距离和拓扑保持情况"
msgstr ""
"When filtering an organic system, prioritize bond lengths, nonbonded "
"distances, and topology preservation."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:256
#: 950e3f2ad48947938f76d2b41e5c7d18
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Common questions"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:258
#: 07af223d9a584fd69bf0fb9c1365b8cf
msgid ""
"**输出数量明显小于请求值。** 其余候选没有通过保护条件。先检查预览中的检测键和"
"可旋转键是否合理，再收窄 `扭转角增量`（`torsion_range_deg`）、减小高斯噪声，"
"或调整真正导致失败的保护阈值。增大 `最大重试次数`（`max_retries`）只会用更小"
"扰动继续尝试。"
msgstr "**The output count is far below the request.** The remaining candidates failed protection checks. First inspect whether the detected and rotatable bonds in the preview are reasonable, then narrow `Torsion-angle range` (`torsion_range_deg`), reduce Gaussian noise, or adjust the threshold that actually causes failure. Increasing `Maximum retries` (`max_retries`) only retries with smaller perturbations."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:260
#: 5e546470d43e4fd183081e568ab77b4c
msgid ""
"**键被拉断了。** `启用最大保留键长`（`bond_keep_max_enable`）没开，或者 `最大"
"保留键长系数`（`bond_keep_max_factor`）太大。开启该约束并设定合理上限。"
msgstr "**A bond was stretched too far.** `Enable maximum kept-bond length` (`bond_keep_max_enable`) is disabled, or `Maximum kept-bond length factor` (`bond_keep_max_factor`) is too large. Enable the constraint and set a reasonable upper bound."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:262
#: 7b25c9d364984249a3004d1e80cf18be
msgid ""
"**非键原子穿插。** `非键原子最小距离系数`（`nonbond_min_factor`）太小。增大"
"到 0.9~1.0。"
msgstr "**Nonbonded atoms interpenetrate.** `Nonbonded minimum-distance factor` (`nonbond_min_factor`) is too small. Increase it to 0.9–1.0."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:264
#: ca0c3b085add47caa7396b8dfadd5e81
msgid ""
"**预览显示 0 条可旋转键。** 环内键、多重键、端基键以及一侧没有邻居的键不会参"
"与子树旋转。若高斯噪声大于 0，卡片仍能生成坐标扰动；若只想做这种扰动，"
"`Atomic Perturb` 更直接。"
msgstr "**The preview shows zero rotatable bonds.** Ring bonds, multiple bonds, terminal bonds, and bonds with no neighbors on one side do not participate in subtree rotation. If Gaussian noise is nonzero, the card can still generate coordinate perturbations; use `Atomic Perturb` directly if that is all you need."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:266
#: 658f97fe331341e7b3b89e27caaf206c
msgid ""
"**普通无周期分子在 Auto 下报奇异 cell。** 当前版本会按输入的 PBC 标志判断，不"
"会再把零 cell 当成周期晶胞；如果仍看到该错误，请确认是否手动选择了“强制全三"
"维 PBC”。"
msgstr "**An ordinary nonperiodic molecule reports a singular cell in Auto mode.** The current version uses the input PBC flags and no longer treats a zero cell as periodic. If the error persists, check whether `Force full 3D PBC` was selected manually."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:268
#: fa666f9661f2433fa04decf8823a701f
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:270
#: 25abf94922c040ff9094aef137c8cda8
msgid "`TG(req={请求数},ok={实际成功数},sig={sigma},pbc={模式})`"
msgstr "`TG(req={requested},ok={actual_successes},sig={sigma},pbc={mode})`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:272
#: de7d5cd4e29943de8c43a9835d68aa0a
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:274
#: 279e2144d6da459f8cb5a19291d6544d
msgid ""
"勾选 `使用随机种子`（`use_seed`） + 固定 `随机种子`（`seed`） → 相同输入可复"
"现。构象生成受 seed + 结构稳定 ID 联合控制，不同 seed 产生不同的扭转角和扰动"
"方向。"
msgstr "Enable `Use random seed` (`use_seed`) and fix `Random seed` (`seed`) to reproduce the same input. Conformation generation is controlled jointly by the seed and stable structure ID; different seeds produce different torsion angles and perturbation directions."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "对有机分子体系进行扭转角采样 + 高斯局域扰动，生成构象候选用作训练数据。通"
#~ "过键长约束和非键最小距离约束保证输出的化学合理性——不会把构象采样做成断键采"
#~ "样。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Generate training candidates for organic molecular systems by combining "
#~ "torsional sampling with local Gaussian perturbations. Bond-length and "
#~ "nonbonded-distance constraints reject chemically implausible results, "
#~ "keeping conformation sampling distinct from bond-breaking sampling."

#~ msgid "**输入：** 一个有机分子晶体结构，分子拓扑可由程序自动识别"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Input:** An organic molecular-crystal structure whose molecular "
#~ "topology can be inferred automatically."

#~ msgid "`Bond Keep Min Factor` = `[0.6]`，`Bond Keep Max Enable` = 勾选"
#~ msgstr "`Bond Keep Min Factor` = `[0.6]`; enable `Bond Keep Max Enable`."

#~ msgid "**输出：** 最多 100 个构象，带 `TG(n=100,sig=0.03,pbc=auto)` 标签"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Output:** Up to 100 conformations labeled `TG(n=100,sig=0.03,pbc=auto)`."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "抽查键长分布：输出分子中没有明显短于 `0.6 * r0` 或长于 `1.15 * r0` 的键"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Inspect the bond-length distribution. Output molecules should have no "
#~ "bonds appreciably shorter than `0.6 * r0` or longer than `1.15 * r0`."

#~ msgid "抽查非键距离：没有不同片段原子重叠（距离 > `0.8 * r_vdw`）"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Inspect nonbonded distances and confirm that atoms from different "
#~ "fragments do not overlap; distances should exceed `0.8 * r_vdw`."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "如果成功率低（< 10%），放宽 `bond_keep_max_factor` 或增大 `max_retries`"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "If fewer than 10% of candidates are accepted, relax "
#~ "`bond_keep_max_factor` or increase `max_retries`."

#~ msgid "研究有机分子晶体、聚合物、分子体系的构象空间"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "You are exploring conformational space in an organic crystal, polymer, or "
#~ "molecular system."

#~ msgid "分子本身是刚性的（如苯环），扭转采样没有意义"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The molecule is rigid, such as an isolated benzene ring, so torsional "
#~ "sampling adds no meaningful degree of freedom."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`int`，默认 100。每个输入帧生成多少个构象候选，20~100 为常规。实际有效输"
#~ "出 = 候选数 x 成功率，后面约束越严、保留率越低，产出的结构数可能明显少于候"
#~ "选数。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default: `100`. Number of conformation candidates attempted per "
#~ "input frame; 20–100 is typical. The effective output count is the "
#~ "candidate count multiplied by the acceptance rate. Stricter constraints "
#~ "lower that rate, so the card may return substantially fewer structures "
#~ "than requested."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`tuple[float, float]`，默认 `(-180.0, 180.0)`。二面角旋转范围（度），格式 "
#~ "`[最小值, 最大值]`。±30° 保守，±180° 全覆盖。范围越大成功率越低，你需要权"
#~ "衡覆盖面和出产率。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`tuple[float, float]`, default: `(-180.0, 180.0)`. Dihedral rotation "
#~ "range in degrees, expressed as `[minimum, maximum]`. ±30° is "
#~ "conservative; ±180° spans the full angular range. Wider scans typically "
#~ "reduce acceptance, so balance coverage against yield."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`int`，默认 50。每个构象最多旋转几个二面角，常规 1~5。设越多构象越复杂、成"
#~ "功率越低，建议从 3 起步试探。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default: `50`. Maximum number of dihedrals rotated in one "
#~ "candidate. A practical range is 1–5. Rotating more dihedrals creates more "
#~ "complex conformations and lowers acceptance; start with 3 when tuning a "
#~ "new system."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`float`，默认 0.03 Å。局域高斯扰动的标准差，常规 0.01~0.03。数值越大原子偏"
#~ "移越剧烈。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default: `0.03` Å. Standard deviation of the local Gaussian "
#~ "displacement. A typical range is 0.01–0.03 Å; larger values produce "
#~ "stronger coordinate perturbations."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`int`，默认 12。每个构象候选在约束失败后的最大重试次数。增大能提高成功率但"
#~ "线性增加耗时——设到 20 以上时先检查是不是约束太严了。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default: `12`. Maximum retries after a candidate fails the "
#~ "constraints. Increasing it can improve yield but raises cost linearly. "
#~ "Before using more than 20 retries, check whether the constraints "
#~ "themselves are unnecessarily strict."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`str`，默认 `'auto'`。构象扰动时的周期边界处理方式，可选 `auto` / `pbc` / "
#~ "`nonpbc`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`str`, default: `'auto'`. Periodic-boundary treatment during conformation "
#~ "perturbation. Choices are `auto`, `pbc`, and `nonpbc`."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`int`，默认 200。局部构象扰动的影响范围。小 cutoff 更局域，大 cutoff 会带"
#~ "动更大分子片段一起动——柔性链或配体适合调大。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default: `200`. Spatial extent of a local conformational "
#~ "perturbation. A smaller cutoff localizes the change; a larger cutoff "
#~ "moves a larger molecular fragment and may be appropriate for flexible "
#~ "chains or ligands."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`int`，默认 100。打开后扭转沿分子拓扑传播到子树，适合真实单键旋转；关掉时"
#~ "更像纯局部坐标噪声。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default: `100`. When enabled, a torsion propagates through the "
#~ "molecular-topology subtree, as expected for rotation about a real single "
#~ "bond. When disabled, the operation behaves more like local coordinate "
#~ "noise."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`float`，默认 100.0 Å。非周期分子包围盒尺寸。盒子太小会制造假镜像接触，太"
#~ "大只增加体积相关过滤风险。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default: `100.0` Å. Bounding-box size for a nonperiodic "
#~ "molecule. A box that is too small creates artificial image contacts; an "
#~ "excessively large box can interact poorly with volume-based filters."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`float`，默认 1.15。成键检测因子，数值越大越容易把较远的原子对判定为成键。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default: `1.15`. Bond-detection factor. Larger values make more "
#~ "distant atom pairs likely to be classified as bonded."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`float`，默认 0.6。允许的最短键长 = `factor * r0`（r0 为平衡键长）。设太小"
#~ "会放过断键结构，设太大又可能拒绝略压缩的合理构象。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default: `0.6`. Minimum allowed bond length, `factor * r0`, "
#~ "where `r0` is the reference bond length. A value that is too small admits "
#~ "broken or collapsed geometries; one that is too large rejects reasonably "
#~ "compressed conformations."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`float`，默认 1.15。允许的最长键长上限系数。值太小会拒绝合理的柔性拉伸构"
#~ "象，太大又可能放过实质断键的结构。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default: `1.15`. Maximum bond-length factor. Too small a value "
#~ "rejects legitimate flexible stretching; too large a value can admit "
#~ "effectively broken bonds."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`bool`，默认 false。打开后才启用键长上限检查。当你需要严格保护分子内键不被"
#~ "拉伸时打开；但如果体系本身含软键或反应路径，打开反而会误删高能但有意义的构"
#~ "型。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`bool`, default: `false`. Enables the maximum bond-length check. Use it "
#~ "when intramolecular bonds must remain intact. For systems with soft bonds "
#~ "or reactive pathways, it may reject high-energy but scientifically "
#~ "relevant configurations."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`float`，默认 0.87。多重键（C=C、C=O、芳香环等）的识别系数。含这些键的体系"
#~ "需要用它限制扭转自由度；纯单键柔性分子影响很小。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default: `0.87`. Detection factor for multiple bonds such as "
#~ "C=C, C=O, and aromatic bonds. It restricts torsional freedom in systems "
#~ "containing such bonds and has little effect on molecules dominated by "
#~ "flexible single bonds."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`float`，默认 0.3。键级估计的衰减常数，影响哪些键被当成强键保护。除非你在"
#~ "调试键识别，保持默认就好。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default: `0.3`. Decay constant used in bond-order estimation and "
#~ "therefore in deciding which bonds receive strong protection. Keep the "
#~ "default unless you are diagnosing bond detection."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`float`，默认 0.2。化学键保留的键级阈值。阈值越高，只有更强的键被识别和保"
#~ "护；阈值越低，更多弱相互作用被当成键，可能过度限制构象自由度。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default: `0.2`. Bond-order threshold for preserving chemical "
#~ "bonds. Raising it protects only stronger bonds; lowering it classifies "
#~ "more weak interactions as bonds and may overconstrain conformational "
#~ "freedom."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`float`，默认 0.8。非键原子允许的最近距离 = `factor * r_vdw`（r_vdw 为范德"
#~ "华半径）。发现原子穿插时调大到 0.9~1.0。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default: `0.8`. Minimum nonbonded distance, `factor * r_vdw`, "
#~ "where `r_vdw` is the van der Waals reference distance used by the "
#~ "implementation. Increase this to 0.9–1.0 if atoms interpenetrate."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`int`，默认 0。固定随机种子值。仅 `use_seed` 打开时生效，两个不同 seed 产"
#~ "生两组不同的扭转角和扰动方向。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default: `0`. Fixed random seed used only when `use_seed` is "
#~ "enabled. Different seeds produce different torsion angles and "
#~ "perturbation directions."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**输出成功率很低（<10%）。** 约束太严或者扭转范围太大导致大部分候选被拒"
#~ "绝。先收窄 `torsion_range_deg`，增大 `max_retries`，放宽 "
#~ "`bond_keep_max_factor`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**The acceptance rate is below 10%.** Most candidates are being rejected "
#~ "because the constraints are too strict or the torsion range is too wide. "
#~ "First narrow `torsion_range_deg`, then increase `max_retries` or relax "
#~ "`bond_keep_max_factor` as justified by the chemistry."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**键被拉断了。** `bond_keep_max_enable` 没开，或者 `bond_keep_max_factor` "
#~ "太大。开启该约束并设定合理上限。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Bonds are being stretched to the point of breaking.** "
#~ "`bond_keep_max_enable` is disabled or `bond_keep_max_factor` is too "
#~ "large. Enable the upper bond-length constraint and choose a chemically "
#~ "defensible limit."

#~ msgid "**非键原子穿插。** `nonbond_min_factor` 太小。增大到 0.9~1.0。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Nonbonded atoms interpenetrate.** Increase `nonbond_min_factor` to 0.9–"
#~ "1.0."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**扭转角采样没有效果。** 确认分子中存在可旋转的单键。刚性环分子没有可旋转"
#~ "二面角。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Torsional sampling has no visible effect.** Confirm that the molecule "
#~ "contains a rotatable single bond. A rigid ring has no freely rotatable "
#~ "dihedral."

#, python-brace-format
#~ msgid "`TG(n={候选数},sig={sigma},pbc={模式})`"
#~ msgstr "`TG(n={candidate count},sig={sigma},pbc={mode})`"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "勾选 `use_seed` + 固定 `seed` → 相同输入可复现。构象生成受 seed + 结构稳"
#~ "定 ID 联合控制，不同 seed 产生不同的扭转角和扰动方向。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Enable `use_seed` and fix `seed` to reproduce the result for the same "
#~ "input. Conformation generation is controlled jointly by the seed and the "
#~ "structure's stable ID; different seeds produce different torsions and "
#~ "perturbation directions."
